"This is used by the macOS service that manages isolated storage areas for apps. Deleting it is generally safe but some apps may need to re-establish their storage areas." = "macOS 管理应用隔离存储区域的服务使用的数据。通常可以安全删除，但部分应用可能需要重新建立存储区域。";

/* storekitagent */
"In-App Purchase Service" = "应用内购买服务";
"Temporary data for in-app purchases and App Store transactions. Nothing is lost, but apps may ask you to restore purchases or sign in again." = "应用内购买与 App Store 交易的临时数据。不会丢失内容，但应用可能要求恢复购买或重新登录。";

/* docker */
"Docker Containers" = "Docker 容器";
"This is Docker Desktop's virtual disk. It holds every image, container, and volume you have. Images can be pulled again, but volumes often hold database data that exists nowhere else. To free space and keep your volumes, run docker --context desktop-linux system prune while Docker Desktop is running. Quit Docker Desktop before deleting this folder." = "这是 Docker Desktop 的虚拟磁盘，保存你的所有镜像、容器和卷。镜像可再次拉取，但卷通常包含没有其他副本的数据库数据。若想释放空间并保留卷，请在 Docker Desktop 运行时执行 docker --context desktop-linux system prune。删除此文件夹前，请先退出 Docker Desktop。";

/* raycast */
"Raycast Launcher" = "Raycast 启动器";
"This stores temporary data for Raycast, a productivity launcher app. It is safe to delete and Raycast will rebuild it automatically." = "效率启动器应用 Raycast 的临时数据。可以安全删除，Raycast 会自动重建。";

/* DerivedData */
"Xcode Build Files" = "Xcode 构建文件";
"Temporary files Xcode creates while building apps. Always safe to delete — your next build will just take a little longer." = "Xcode 构建应用时创建的临时文件，始终可以安全删除，只是下次构建会稍慢。";

