"Compiled pages and assets produced by Next.js. Safe to delete and rebuilt the next time you run or build the site." = "Next.js 生成的已编译页面与资源。可以安全删除，下次运行或构建网站时会重建。";

/* nuxt-build */
"Nuxt Build Cache" = "Nuxt 构建缓存";
"Temporary build files created by Nuxt. Safe to delete and rebuilt the next time you run or build the site." = "Nuxt 创建的临时构建文件。可以安全删除，下次运行或构建网站时会重建。";

/* nuxt-output */
"Nuxt Output" = "Nuxt 输出";
"The built site Nuxt produces for deployment. Safe to delete and rebuilt on your next build." = "Nuxt 为部署生成的网站构建产物。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* sveltekit-build */
"SvelteKit Build Cache" = "SvelteKit 构建缓存";
"Generated files SvelteKit keeps between builds. Safe to delete and rebuilt the next time you run the project." = "SvelteKit 在构建之间保留的生成文件。可以安全删除，下次运行项目时会重建。";

/* astro-build */
"Astro Build Cache" = "Astro 构建缓存";
"Temporary build files created by Astro. Safe to delete and rebuilt on your next build." = "Astro 创建的临时构建文件。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* angular-cache */
"Angular Build Cache" = "Angular 构建缓存";
"Build cache kept by the Angular CLI to make repeat builds faster. Safe to delete and rebuilt automatically." = "Angular CLI 为加快后续构建而保存的缓存。可以安全删除，会自动重建。";

/* pytest-cache */
"pytest Cache" = "pytest 缓存";
"Test results and lookup data cached by pytest. Safe to delete and recreated the next time you run your tests." = "pytest 缓存的测试结果与查找数据。可以安全删除，下次运行测试时会重新创建。";

/* tox-environments */
"tox Environments" = "tox 环境";
"Throwaway Python environments tox builds to run tests in. Safe to delete and rebuilt on your next tox run, which re-downloads packages." = "tox 为运行测试而创建的临时 Python 环境。可以安全删除，下次运行 tox 时会重建，并重新下载软件包。";

/* swiftpm-build */
"Swift Package Build" = "Swift 软件包构建";
"Compiled output from Swift Package Manager. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next swift build." = "Swift 软件包管理器生成的已编译输出。可以安全删除，下次 swift build 时会重建。";

/* maven-target */
"Maven Build Output" = "Maven 构建输出";
"Compiled classes and packaged output produced by Maven. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build." = "Maven 生成的已编译类与打包输出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* gradle-build */
"Gradle Build Output" = "Gradle 构建输出";
"Compiled output produced by a Gradle build. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build." = "Gradle 构建生成的已编译输出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* sbt-target */
"sbt Build Output" = "sbt 构建输出";
"Compiled output produced by sbt for a Scala project. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build." = "sbt 为 Scala 项目生成的已编译输出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* dotnet-bin */
"NET Build Output" = ".NET 构建输出";
"Compiled programs and libraries produced by a .NET build. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next dotnet build." = ".NET 构建生成的已编译程序与代码库。可以安全删除，下次 dotnet build 时会重建。";

/* dotnet-obj */
"NET Intermediate Files" = ".NET 中间文件";
"Temporary files .NET creates while compiling. Safe to delete and recreated on your next build." = ".NET 编译时创建的临时文件。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重新创建。";

/* composer-vendor */
"PHP Packages" = "PHP 软件包";
"Third-party PHP packages downloaded by Composer. Safe to delete and re-downloaded by composer install, which needs an internet connection." = "Composer 下载的第三方 PHP 软件包。可以安全删除，通过 composer install 重新下载时，需要互联网连接。";

/* bundler-vendor */
"Ruby Gems" = "Ruby Gem 软件包";
"Ruby gems installed into the project by Bundler. Safe to delete and reinstalled by bundle install, which needs an internet connection." = "Bundler 为项目安装的 Ruby Gem。可以安全删除，通过 bundle install 重新安装时，需要互联网连接。";

/* stack-work */
"Stack Build Output" = "Stack 构建输出";
"Compiled output and dependencies kept by Stack for a Haskell project. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build, which can take a while." = "Stack 为 Haskell 项目保存的已编译输出与依赖。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建，可能需要一些时间。";

/* cabal-dist */
"Cabal Build Output" = "Cabal 构建输出";
"Compiled output produced by Cabal for a Haskell project. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build, which can take a while." = "Cabal 为 Haskell 项目生成的已编译输出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建，可能需要一些时间。";

/* zig-cache */
"Zig Build Cache" = "Zig 构建缓存";
"Compilation cache kept by Zig. Safe to delete and rebuilt on your next build." = "Zig 保存的编译缓存。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* zig-out */
"Zig Build Output" = "Zig 构建输出";
"Finished programs and libraries produced by a Zig build. Safe to delete and rebuilt on your next build." = "Zig 构建生成的最终程序与代码库。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* dune-build */
"Dune Build Output" = "Dune 构建输出";
"Compiled output produced by Dune for an OCaml project. Safe to delete and rebuilt by your next build." = "Dune 为 OCaml 项目生成的已编译输出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重建。";

/* cmake-build */
"CMake Build Output" = "CMake 构建输出";
"Compiled output and build configuration produced by CMake. Safe to delete, though you will need to configure and build the project again." = "CMake 生成的已编译输出与构建配置。可以安全删除，但之后需重新配置并构建项目。";

/* terraform-plugins */
"Terraform Plugins" = "Terraform 插件";
"Provider plugins and modules Terraform downloads for a workspace. Safe to delete and re-downloaded by terraform init." = "Terraform 为工作区下载的提供方插件与模块。可以安全删除，运行 terraform init 时会重新下载。";

/* godot-cache */
"Godot Project Cache" = "Godot 项目缓存";
"Imported assets and editor data Godot keeps for a project. Safe to delete and rebuilt the next time you open the project." = "Godot 为项目保留的导入资源与编辑器数据。可以安全删除，下次打开项目时会重建。";

/* unity-library */
"Unity Library Folder" = "Unity Library 文件夹";
"Unity's imported-asset database for this project. It rebuilds itself, but reimporting a large project can take a long time, so check before removing it." = "Unity 为此项目保存的导入资源数据库。可自行重建，但重新导入大型项目可能耗时很长，因此移除前请检查。";

/* unity-temp */
"Unity Temp Folder" = "Unity 临时文件夹";
"Scratch files Unity writes while the editor is running. Recreated automatically, but do not remove it while the project is open in Unity." = "Unity 编辑器运行期间写入的临时工作文件。会自动重新创建，但项目在 Unity 中打开时请勿移除。";

/* unreal-intermediate */
"Unreal Intermediate Files" = "Unreal 中间文件";
"Generated build files Unreal creates while compiling a project. They come back on the next build, which will take longer than usual." = "Unreal 编译项目时生成的构建文件。下次构建时会重新生成，但构建会比平时更慢。";

/* unreal-derived-data */
"Unreal Derived Data Cache" = "Unreal 派生数据缓存";
"Cooked assets and compiled shaders Unreal caches for a project. Rebuilt automatically, but the first build afterwards can be very slow." = "Unreal 为项目缓存的烘焙资源与已编译着色器。会自动重建，但清理后的首次构建可能非常慢。";

/* nuget-packages */
"NuGet Package Cache" = "NuGet 软件包缓存";
"Downloaded .NET packages that NuGet restores your projects from. Nothing is lost, but your next restore downloads them all again, which can take a while and does not work offline." = "NuGet 用于恢复项目的已下载 .NET 软件包。不会丢失内容，但下次恢复需重新下载全部软件包，可能需要一些时间，且无法离线完成。";

/* stack-global */
"Stack Global Cache" = "Stack 全局缓存";
"Package downloads and prebuilt libraries that Stack shares between Haskell projects. Your settings and installed compilers are left alone. Nothing is lost, but the next build downloads and rebuilds a lot and can be slow." = "Stack 在 Haskell 项目之间共享的软件包下载与预编译代码库。不会动设置或已安装的编译器。不会丢失内容，但下次构建需下载并重建大量内容，可能较慢。";

/* cabal-packages */
"Cabal Package Cache" = "Cabal 软件包缓存";
"Haskell packages downloaded by Cabal. Nothing is lost, but your next build downloads and rebuilds them, which can take a long time." = "Cabal 下载的 Haskell 软件包。不会丢失内容，但下次构建需重新下载并构建，可能耗时较长。";

/* bazel-cache */
"Bazel Build Cache" = "Bazel 构建缓存";
"Build outputs Bazel caches between builds. Safe to delete, though the next build starts from scratch and can be slow." = "Bazel 在构建之间缓存的构建输出。可以安全删除，但下次需从头构建，可能较慢。";

/* swiftpm-cache */
"Swift Package Cache" = "Swift 软件包缓存";
"Package checkouts Swift Package Manager shares between projects. Safe to delete and re-downloaded on your next build." = "Swift 软件包管理器在项目间共享的软件包检出。可以安全删除，下次构建时会重新下载。";

/* venv */
"Python Environment" = "Python 环境";
"A self-contained Python environment holding packages installed for one project. Safe to delete and recreated by reinstalling from requirements.txt or pyproject.toml, which needs an internet connection." = "为单个项目保存已安装软件包的独立 Python 环境。可以安全删除，但需根据 requirements.txt 或 pyproject.toml 重新安装以重建，并需要互联网连接。";

/* node-gyp-headers */
"node-gyp Headers" = "node-gyp 头文件";
"Node.js header files that node-gyp downloads to build native add-ons. Safe to delete; it downloads them again on the next native build." = "node-gyp 为构建原生扩展而下载的 Node.js 头文件。可以安全删除，下次原生构建时会重新下载。";

/* typescript-type-cache */
"TypeScript Type Cache" = "TypeScript 类型缓存";
"Type definitions your editor downloaded so plain JavaScript files get autocomplete. Safe to delete; the editor downloads them again as needed." = "编辑器下载的类型定义，为普通 JavaScript 文件提供自动补全。可以安全删除，编辑器会按需重新下载。";

/* cursor-compile-cache */
"Cursor Startup Cache" = "Cursor 启动缓存";
"Compiled code that Cursor saves so it starts faster. Safe to delete; Cursor rebuilds it the next time it opens." = "Cursor 为加快启动而保存的已编译代码。可以安全删除，下次打开 Cursor 时会重建。";

/* claude-cli-cache */
"Claude Code Logs" = "Claude Code 日志";
"Logs that Claude Code writes for its MCP servers, one folder per project. Safe to delete; new logs are written as you use it." = "Claude Code 为其 MCP 服务器写入的日志，每个项目一个文件夹。可以安全删除，使用时会写入新日志。";

/* apple-python-cache */
"Apple Python Cache" = "Apple Python 缓存";
"Compiled files for the Python that comes with the macOS developer tools. Safe to delete; Python recreates them when it next runs." = "macOS 开发工具附带的 Python 使用的已编译文件。可以安全删除，下次运行 Python 时会重新创建。";

/* jna-libraries */
"Java Native Libraries" = "Java 原生代码库";
"Native libraries that Java apps unpack here when they start. Safe to delete; they are unpacked again on the next launch." = "Java 应用在启动时解包到这里的原生代码库。可以安全删除，下次启动时会重新解包。";

/* dictionary-services */
"Dictionary Cache" = "词典缓存";
"Temporary data for the macOS Dictionary and Look Up. Safe to delete; it is rebuilt the next time you look up a word." = "macOS 词典和查询功能的临时数据。可以安全删除，下次查询单词时会重建。";

/* promoted-content */
"App Store Ads Cache" = "App Store 广告缓存";
"Data for the ads Apple shows in the App Store. Safe to delete; it is downloaded again when needed." = "Apple 在 App Store 显示广告所用的数据。可以安全删除，需要时会重新下载。";

/* device-software-updates */
"iPhone and iPad Software Updates" = "iPhone 与 iPad 软件更新";
"Full software update files for iPhone, iPad or iPod that Finder downloaded to update or restore a device, often 5 to 8 GB each. Safe to delete; Finder downloads the current one again the next time you update a device." = "访达为更新或恢复设备而下载的 iPhone、iPad 或 iPod 完整软件更新文件，每个通常为 5 至 8 GB。可以安全删除，下次更新设备时，访达会重新下载当前版本。";

/* davinci-cacheclip */
"DaVinci Resolve Render Cache" = "DaVinci Resolve 渲染缓存";
"Render cache and optimized media that DaVinci Resolve keeps in your Movies folder. Safe to delete; Resolve renders it again as you work, which takes time on large projects." = "DaVinci Resolve 保存在“影片”文件夹中的渲染缓存与优化媒体。可以安全删除；继续工作时 Resolve 会重新渲染，大型项目需要一些时间。";

/* aerial-wallpaper-videos */
"Aerial Wallpaper Videos" = "航拍壁纸视频";
"Videos for the macOS aerial wallpapers and screen savers, often several GB. Nothing is lost, but the aerial you use downloads again, and macOS may download others again on its own." = "macOS 航拍壁纸与屏幕保护程序的视频，通常占用数 GB。不会丢失内容，但正在使用的航拍视频需重新下载，macOS 也可能自行重新下载其他视频。";

/* messages-previews */
"Messages Previews" = "信息预览";
"Thumbnail previews of photos, videos and links in Messages. Your messages and attachments are not touched. Safe to delete; previews are made again when you scroll through a conversation." = "信息应用中照片、视频和链接的缩略图预览。不会动消息或附件。可以安全删除，滚动浏览会话时会重新生成预览。";

/* mail-downloads */
"Mail Attachment Copies" = "邮件附件副本";
"Copies of attachments you opened from Apple Mail. The originals stay in your mail. If you edited an attachment after opening it and never saved it somewhere else, those edits are only here. Held back while Mail is open." = "从 Apple 邮件打开的附件副本。原件仍保留在邮件中。如果打开后编辑了附件，且从未另存到其他位置，这些修改只保存在这里。邮件应用打开时，暂不纳入清理。";

/* unfinished-downloads */
"Unfinished Downloads" = "未完成的下载";
"Downloads from Safari, Chrome or Firefox that stopped before finishing and have not changed in over a week. A browser can sometimes still resume one, so check before deleting." = "Safari、Chrome 或 Firefox 中未完成、且超过一周没有变化的下载。浏览器有时仍可继续下载，因此删除前请检查。";

/* coresimulator-caches */
"Simulator Caches" = "模拟器缓存";
"Shared system caches the iOS Simulator builds for each runtime. Safe to delete; the Simulator builds them again the next time a device starts, which makes that first launch slower." = "iOS 模拟器为每个运行时构建的共享系统缓存。可以安全删除，下次设备启动时模拟器会重建，因此首次启动会更慢。";

/* xctest-devices */
"Xcode Test Devices" = "Xcode 测试设备";
"Temporary copies of simulators that Xcode makes to run tests in parallel. Xcode deletes them itself but sometimes leaves them behind. Safe to delete when no tests are running." = "Xcode 为并行测试创建的临时模拟器副本。Xcode 会自行删除，但有时会留下。仅在没有测试运行时，才可安全删除。";

/* old-cli-versions */
"Old AI Coding Tool Versions" = "旧版 AI 编程工具";
"Earlier versions of Claude Code or Cursor Agent that stayed behind after updates. The version you run and the newest one are kept. Safe to delete." = "Claude Code 或 Cursor Agent 更新后遗留的旧版本。正在运行的版本与最新版本会保留。可以安全删除。";

/* pre-commit-cache */
"pre-commit Environments" = "pre-commit 环境";
"Tool environments that pre-commit sets up to run your git hooks. Safe to delete; they are set up again on your next commit, which makes that commit slow." = "pre-commit 为运行 Git 钩子而设置的工具环境。可以安全删除，下次提交时会重新设置，导致该次提交较慢。";

/* expo-cache */
"Expo Cache" = "Expo 缓存";
"App builds, templates and SDK data the Expo tools downloaded. Your Expo login is left alone. Safe to delete; Expo downloads what it needs again." = "Expo 工具下载的应用构建、模板和 SDK 数据。不会动 Expo 登录信息。可以安全删除，Expo 会重新下载所需内容。";

/* version-manager-downloads */
"pyenv and rbenv Downloads" = "pyenv 与 rbenv 下载";
"Source downloads pyenv and rbenv keep after installing a Python or Ruby version. Installed versions are left alone. Safe to delete." = "pyenv 和 rbenv 安装 Python 或 Ruby 版本后保留的源代码下载。已安装的版本不会被动。可以安全删除。";

/* oh-my-zsh-cache */
"Oh My Zsh Cache" = "Oh My Zsh 缓存";
"Completion and update-check files that Oh My Zsh keeps. Safe to delete; they are recreated when you open a new terminal window." = "Oh My Zsh 保留的补全与更新检查文件。可以安全删除，打开新终端窗口时会重新创建。";

/* opam-download-cache */
"opam Download Cache" = "opam 下载缓存";
"Package downloads opam keeps for OCaml. Installed packages are left alone. Safe to delete; opam downloads them again when needed." = "opam 为 OCaml 保留的软件包下载。不会动已安装的软件包。可以安全删除，需要时 opam 会重新下载。";

/* puppeteer-browsers */
"Puppeteer Browsers" = "Puppeteer 浏览器";
"Browsers Puppeteer downloaded for automated testing. Your scripts fail until the browser is installed again, which happens on your next npm install or with npx puppeteer browsers install." = "Puppeteer 为自动化测试下载的浏览器。重新安装浏览器前，脚本会失败；下次运行 npm install 时会自动重新安装，也可以运行 npx puppeteer browsers install 手动安装。";

/* conda-packages */
"Conda Package Cache" = "Conda 软件包缓存";
"Packages conda downloaded and unpacked to build your environments. Your environments keep working because they link to these files, which also means deleting frees less space than shown until those environments are removed. Running conda clean --all does this more carefully." = "conda 为构建环境而下载并解包的软件包。环境通过链接使用这些文件，因此仍可继续运行；这也意味着，在移除这些环境前，删除所释放的空间会少于显示值。运行 conda clean --all 会更谨慎地处理清理。";
